{"seq":7,"slug":"emotion-motivation-psychology","title":"情绪与动机心理学","stage":"DONE","category":"psychology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology","rating":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.36,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 情绪与动机心理学 简介\n\n情绪与动机是驱动人类行为的两大核心心理力量。情绪赋予我们对世界的即时评价与反应能力，动机则为行为提供方向和持续的推动力。本模块面向具有一定心理学基础的读者，尤其适合希望深入理解自身情感体验与行为动力的技术从业者和终身学习者。无论是在高压环境中进行情绪管理，还是在长期项目中维持内在驱动力，情绪与动机心理学的知识都具有直接而深远的实践价值。\n\n第1章**情绪理论**系统梳理了心理学界对\"情绪是什么\"这一根本问题的不同回答。从达尔文和艾克曼关于基本情绪的经典主张，到拉扎勒斯的认知评价理论强调思维在情绪生成中的核心作用，再到巴瑞特提出的建构主义理论对传统情绪观的根本性挑战，最后聚焦于格罗斯的情绪调节过程模型，揭示人类如何主动管理和改变自身的情绪体验。四种理论视角层层递进，构成对情绪本质的多维理解。\n\n第2章**情感科学**从实证研究的前沿视角探讨情绪的生物学基础与表现形式。从杏仁核、前额叶等关键脑区的神经机制，到面部表情与身体语言的跨文化研究，再到心境与情感作为不同时间尺度上情感现象的区分，最后深入积极情绪的功能与价值。本章帮助读者建立对情感现象从脑到行为的完整认知链条。\n\n第3章**动机理论**追溯人类对行为驱动力的科学探索历程。从赫尔的驱力理论解释生物性需要如何转化为行为动力，到德西和瑞安的自我决定理论揭示自主、胜任和关系三种基本心理需要，再到期望-价值理论阐明认知评估如何影响行为选择，最后到洛克的目标设定理论提出明确而有挑战性的目标如何激发卓越表现。四种理论从不同层面回答了\"人为什么行动\"的核心问题。\n\n第4章**动机的应用**将理论知识落地到真实的生活与工作场景中。从内在动机与外在动机的辩证关系及其对创造力的差异化影响，到契克森米哈赖的心流体验理论揭示最优体验的心理条件，再到拖延行为的认知-情绪机制与循证干预策略，最后聚焦成就动机理论解析高成就者的心理特征与发展路径。本章为读者提供可直接应用的自我提升工具。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先从第1章入手建立情绪理论的宏观框架，理解不同学派如何定义和解释情绪现象；然后学习第2章了解情绪的生物基础与科学测量；接着进入第3章探索动机的理论根基；最后通过第4章将理论与实践连接。四章内容从情绪到动机、从理论到应用，形成由内到外、由知到行的完整知识体系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"emotion-theories","title":"情绪理论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/emotion-theories","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"basic-emotions","title":"基本情绪理论","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/emotion-theories/basic-emotions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cognitive-appraisal","title":"认知评价理论","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/emotion-theories/cognitive-appraisal"},{"seq":3,"slug":"constructionist-theory","title":"情绪建构理论","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/emotion-theories/constructionist-theory"},{"seq":4,"slug":"emotion-regulation","title":"情绪调节","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/emotion-theories/emotion-regulation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"affective-science","title":"情感科学","docCount":4,"url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/affective-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neural-basis-emotion","title":"情绪的神经基础","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/affective-science/neural-basis-emotion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emotion-expression","title":"情绪表达","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/affective-science/emotion-expression"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mood-affect","title":"心境与情感","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/affective-science/mood-affect"},{"seq":4,"slug":"positive-emotions","title":"积极情绪","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/affective-science/positive-emotions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"motivation-theories","title":"动机理论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/motivation-theories","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"drive-theory","title":"驱力理论","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/motivation-theories/drive-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-determination","title":"自我决定理论","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/motivation-theories/self-determination"},{"seq":3,"slug":"expectancy-value","title":"期望-价值理论","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/motivation-theories/expectancy-value"},{"seq":4,"slug":"goal-setting","title":"目标设定理论","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/motivation-theories/goal-setting"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applied-motivation","title":"动机的应用","docCount":4,"url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/applied-motivation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intrinsic-extrinsic","title":"内在动机与外在动机","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/applied-motivation/intrinsic-extrinsic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flow-experience","title":"心流体验","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/applied-motivation/flow-experience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"procrastination","title":"拖延行为","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/applied-motivation/procrastination"},{"seq":4,"slug":"achievement-motivation","title":"成就动机","url":"/h/psychology/emotion-motivation-psychology/applied-motivation/achievement-motivation"}]}]}